LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 4)
# SumRuleCyl-like: a FENE chain and crowders in a cylinder; thermo_style one.
# Runs: 0 minimize; 1 equilibration (nve/limit); 2-4 production, one
# trajectory file per run (loop, as in the projects);
# 5 the crowders' wall is removed, so crowders leave through the fixed
# x and y boundaries and "WARNING: Lost atoms" lines appear in the table.

units           lj
dimension       3
boundary        f f p
atom_style      bond

variable        randseed equal 4928
region          box block -6 6 -6 6 -12 12 units box
create_box      2 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/special/per/atom 6
Created orthogonal box = (-6 -6 -12) to (6 6 12)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
region          cyl cylinder z 0.0 0.0 5.0 INF INF units box
region          cylin cylinder z 0.0 0.0 4.0 INF INF units box
molecule        chain chain20.mol
Read molecule template chain:
# linear chain of 20 beads along z, bond length 0.97
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  20 atoms with max type 1
  19 bonds with max type 1
  0 angles with max type 0
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
create_atoms    0 single 0.0 0.0 0.0 mol chain 1234 rotate 0 0 0 1 units box
Created 20 atoms
  using box units in orthogonal box = (-6 -6 -12) to (6 6 12)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
create_atoms    2 random 150 ${randseed} cylin overlap 1.0 maxtry 100 units box
create_atoms    2 random 150 4928 cylin overlap 1.0 maxtry 100 units box
Created 150 atoms
  using box units in orthogonal box = (-6 -6 -12) to (6 6 12)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds
mass            * 1.0
group           bug type 1
20 atoms in group bug
group           crowd type 2
150 atoms in group crowd

pair_style      lj/cut 1.122462
pair_modify     shift yes
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 1.122462
bond_style      fene
bond_coeff      1 30.0 1.5 1.0 1.0
special_bonds   fene
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        1        1       
  special bond factors coul:  0        1        1       
     2 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
    13 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

fix             F_wall1 bug wall/region cyl lj126 1.0 1.0 1.122462
fix             F_wall2 crowd wall/region cyl lj126 1.0 1.0 1.122462

thermo          100
thermo_style    one
thermo_modify   flush yes

minimize        1.0e-4 1.0e-6 100 1000
